    "body": "Closed by PR #210, which meets the done-means' 'refused by name before the wrap with the reason' branch: a non-turned feature across the seam is refused by name, a hole in the skin is refused by name, and flats clear of the seam wrap gouge-free. Wrapping a D-flat in any placement (moving the seam to a turned angle) is #226.",
